# Build-context excludes for web.Dockerfile. See api.Dockerfile.dockerignore for why
# this is named after the Dockerfile rather than living in the frontend surface.
#
# node_modules is the one that counts: copying the host's tree over the one `npm ci`
# just installed can mix platform-specific binaries into the image.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/coverage/
**/tmp/
**/out-tsc/
